<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>RavinderAcademy.com Learning</title>
    <style>
        /* Reset default margins */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4, #fbc2eb, #a6c1ee);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            max-width: 800px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 3em;
            color: #ff416c;
            background: -webkit-linear-gradient(#ff4b2b, #ff416c);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.5em;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        h2 span {
            color: #ff6a00;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .highlight {
            color: #1a73e8;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        button {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ff6a00, #ee0979);
            color: #fff;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        }

        button:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 1em;
            color: #555;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>RavinderAcademy.com Learning</h1>
        <h2>Learn <span>QA Automation tools</span> + <span>DevOps Tools CI/CD pipelines</span> in course from Scratch</h2>
        <h2>Good Luck and we are almost done with the course. <span class="highlight">Thank you!</span></h2>
        <button>Start Learning Now</button>
        <footer>&copy; 2025 RavinderAcademy.com | All Rights Reserved</footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
